/* While a lazy image is in flight its reserved box shows the ivue mark
   as a loader: the infinity turns 90° clockwise per beat (infinity → 8 →
   infinity), each landing emphasized with a small overshoot spring. The
   loaded banner is opaque and covers the background entirely, so the
   loader needs no teardown. */
